cTACC           lrevhotlp       DO_CALC_IF crev2tlp
cACC            lrevdvhtlp      DO_CALC_IF crev1atlp
cTACC           lrevdvhtlp      DO_CALC_IF crev2atlp

MAP(mktpmit)
